WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Nobody ever wins the games, period.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.700
They are survivors.

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.500
There's no winners.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.600
Haymitch Abernathy.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:15.700
These are my games.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.200
How you die.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.300
It's all up to me.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.300
Who am I?

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.500
Not nobody.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.800
The Capitol has all the power they always have.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:41.100
It doesn't mean they always will.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.700
Welcome to the Hunger Games.

00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:51.800
Twice the number of tributes, twice the glory.

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:05.200
Look alive, children.

00:01:07.300 --> 00:01:09.500
But the question is,

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.500
why do you agree to it?

00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.800
Why do any of us?

00:01:40.200 --> 00:01:42.700
The arena, it's a killing machine.

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:46.400
But all machines can be broken.

00:01:46.900 --> 00:01:47.900
How would you go about that?

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:52.097
If anyone finds out what you're doing, then we're

00:01:52.097 --> 00:01:52.500
all dead.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:57.200
We're not animals to kill for their entertainment.

